# S3 gallery republish

When you materially change `ghostroll/gallery.py` (HTML/CSS/JS for the share gallery), finish by running `ghostroll republish-gallery <session-id>` and print the new presigned URL on stdout unless the user asked not to deploy.

If the user is iterating on gallery markup, mention they can keep a terminal open with:

`ghostroll republish-gallery <session-id> --watch`

so each save under `ghostroll/` triggers a debounced re-upload automatically.
